77890\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose Your Skills:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start without any usable abilities, but as you progress, you\u2019ll unlock and evolve different attributes to enhance your powers. Choose wisely which skills to develop, as they will help you adapt to the increasing challenges of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525210/extras/gifattributes.gif?t=1742477890\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adjust Your Screen</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different screen positioning options. Ultrawide support! (both vertical and horizontal).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525210/extras/ultrawide.png?t=1742477890\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Fuzzy"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525210/bc45269a6c5d174683eed61429eea15daba167f5/header.jpg?t=1742477890","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116765,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116765/movie480.mp4?t=1742477887","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116765/movie_max.mp4?t=1742477887"},"name":"HuntersOfIdlearth","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116765/2c72d85b5eae7f91bb1f78a6491be287affd7190/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742477887","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116765/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742477887","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116765/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742477887"}}],"name":"Hunters of Idlearth",